         <!--quod dulcis nati quod cara pignera praestant / continet hic tumulus membra qui parva retentat / dolorem sine fine dedit Felicitas isto / clauditur infelix falso cognomine dicta / nam cui prima dies in lucem protulit annus / quattuor et male cum quintum sumeret ortum / abstulit atra dies et funere mersit acervo / haec mater et genitor conscribunt carmina busto // ((orans puella)) // quo legenti simul redeat sub corde figura / et siccato saepe madescant lumina fletu / sic medicatur amor nec curant carmina manes / dep(osita) in p(ace) die kal(endas) iulias (!) / d(omino) n(ostro) Theodosio Aug(usto) et Fl(avio) Rumorido / v(iro) c(larissimo) cons(ulibu)s    --><div type="edition" xml:lang="la"><head>Text</head><div n="1" type="textpart"><ab><lb n="1"/>quod dulcis nati quod cara pignera praestant<lb n="2"/>continet hic tumulus membra qui parva retentat<lb n="3"/>dolorem sine fine dedit Felicitas isto<lb n="4"/>clauditur infelix falso cognomine dicta<lb n="5"/>nam cui prima dies in lucem protulit annus<lb n="6"/>quattuor et male cum quintum sumeret ortum<lb n="7"/>abstulit atra dies et funere mersit acervo<lb n="8"/>haec mater et genitor conscribunt carmina busto </ab></div><div n="2" type="textpart"><ab><lb n="1"/> <g type="descriptive">orans puella</g> </ab></div><div n="3" type="textpart"><ab><lb n="1"/> quo legenti simul redeat sub corde figura<lb n="2"/>et siccato saepe madescant lumina fletu<lb n="3"/>sic medicatur amor nec curant carmina manes<lb n="4"/><expan><abbr>dep</abbr><ex>osita</ex></expan> in <expan><abbr>p</abbr><ex>ace</ex></expan> die <expan><abbr>kal</abbr><ex>endas</ex></expan> iulias  <note>sic</note><lb n="5"/><expan><abbr>d</abbr><ex>omino</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>n</abbr><ex>ostro</ex></expan> Theodosio <expan><abbr>Aug</abbr><ex>usto</ex></expan> et <expan><abbr>Fl</abbr><ex>avio</ex></expan> Rumorido<lb n="6"/><expan><abbr>v</abbr><ex>iro</ex></expan> <expan><abbr>c</abbr><ex>larissimo</ex></expan> cons<expan><ex>ulibu</ex><abbr>s</abbr></expan>    </ab></div></div>
